    "title": "Pushilin: About 2.9 million people live in the DPR, the population continues to grow",
    "text": "Pushilin: About 2.9 million people live in the DPR, the population continues to grow\nHead of the Donetsk People's Republic Denis Pushilin said there are currently about 2.9 million people living on the territory of the DPR – and this number is growing steadily. He announced this on the Rossiya 24 television channel.\n“Now we estimate that about 2 million 900 thousand people currently live on the territory of the republic, and this number is constantly growing,” Pushilin noted. RIA Novosti.\nPushilin added that the observed trend shows that after the region is fully liberated and restored, people will continue to return to their homeland.\nIn February it became known about Rosstat's plans to conduct an all-Russian census no later than 2031.",
